# This file describes files and paths that should not be tracked by Git version control
# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auto-generated code editor files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/*
.vscode/*
*.csproj
obj
bin
Properties/*
code/obj/*
code/Properties/*
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auto-generated asset related files (s&box compiles these from source assets)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.sbox/*
*.generated.*
*.*_c
!*.shader_c
*.los
*.vpk
*launchSettings.json
*.sln
*.slnx

*idea

# Exported / standalone games
Exports/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets & credentials — NEVER commit these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private Network Storage key used only by the editor sync tool.
Editor/Network Storage/config/secret/
# Editor-side credential mirror. Holds the project id + public key; the public
# key is not an auth secret, but the file is machine-local config — see
# Assets/network-storage.credentials.example.json for the expected shape.
Assets/network-storage.credentials.json

# Local agent/tooling config (contains absolute machine paths)
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large map art — excluded from the public repository
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The two playable maps ship as ~530 MB of source FBX meshes and 4K PNG
# textures, including a single 66 MB FBX that exceeds GitHub's file size limit.
# They are distributed with the published game on sbox.game, not via Git.
# Everything needed to read and review the project's code is tracked.
Assets/models/
Assets/map/
